egin="02:18.510" end="02:18.810">just </span><span begin="02:18.810" end="02:19.170">let </span><span begin="02:19.170" end="02:19.410">it </span><span begin="02:19.410" end="02:20.580">begin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.640" end="02:23.760"><span begin="02:20.640" end="02:21.180">Open </span><span begin="02:21.180" end="02:21.390">up </span><span begin="02:21.390" end="02:21.570">your </span><span begin="02:21.570" end="02:23.760">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.990" end="02:29.850"><span begin="02:24.990" end="02:27.180">Acceptance </span><span begin="02:27.180" end="02:27.720">is </span><span begin="02:27.720" end="02:27.810">the </span><span begin="02:27.810" end="02:28.170">key </span><span begin="02:28.170" end="02:28.890">to </span><span begin="02:28.890" end="02:29.850">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.720" end="02:33.510"><span begin="02:30.720" end="02:31.320">To </span><span begin="02:31.320" end="02:31.530">be </span><span begin="02:31.530" end="02:32.550">truly </span><span begin="02:32.550" end="02:33.510">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.260" end="02:42.990"><span begin="02:34.260" end="02:34.650">Will </span><span begin="02:34.650" end="02:35.010">you </span><span begin="02:35.010" end="02:35.310">do </span><span begin="02:35.310" end="02:35.550">the </span><span begin="02:35.550" end="02:36.270">same </span><span begin="02:36.270" end="02:36.840">for </span><span begin="02:36.840" end="02:42.090">me</span><span begin="02:42.090" end="02:42.990">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.990" end="02:50.190"><span begin="02:42.990" end="02:46.620">Unconditional</span><span begin="02:46.620" end="02:46.680">, </span><span begin="02:46.680" end="02:50.190">unconditionally</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.400" end="02:57.360"><span begin="02:50.400" end="02:50.760">I </span><span begin="02:50.760" end="02:51.060">will </span><span begin="02:51.060" end="02:51.390">love </span><span begin="02:51.